{"id":"Wddf0f71154489527dece4582","zh":"固定界面模态综合法","en":"","name":"固定界面模态综合法","language":"zh","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","concept_id":"Cd2bc145149cdc14d4056","families":[],"definition_zh":"固定子结构界面提取主模态并通过界面关系组装降阶模型的动态子结构方法。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wddf0f71154489527dece4582","text":"固定界面模态综合法","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S84cf3cebc1c25ee26e73","source_id":"P133","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"本文基于动态子结构法中的固定界面模态综合法建立隧道−土体−上盖建筑二维有限元模型,通过与整体结构有限元模型计算结果对比,验证该方法在车致环境振动研究中的有效性,并探究人工边界的施加问题。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S5d1bf212fdf1597967d5","source_id":"P133","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"在城市轨道交通环境振动的研究中,冯青松等 [22]将固定界面模态综合法应用于地铁车致建筑物的振动分析,并探究了 CMS 法在环境振动分析中的适用性、准确度与计算效率,同时研究了相关参数对建筑物振动的影响。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P133":{"id":"P133","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","authors":"张小安,王庞瑞,李姝婷,杨建近,徐磊,张晓芸","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20250090","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"张小安等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-prediction-of-building-vibration-induced-by-subway-operation-and-influencing-factors"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"结合固定界面主模态与约束模态构造降阶模型的方法。","language":"zh","source_id":"P133","paper_slug":"2025-study-on-the-prediction-of-building-vibration-induced-by-subway-operation-and-influencing-factors","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wb51e892ecfe22a37097160f4","name":"fixed-interface component mode synthesis","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wb51e892ecfe22a37097160f4","name":"fixed-interface component mode synthesis","language":"en","kind":"